37514>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to False
37515>>>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to False
37516>>>>>
37516>>>>>        If (NavigateData.bReadOnly) Begin
37518>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to True
